# ======================
# SAFE TO COMMIT
# ======================
# These are explicitly NOT ignored:
# template.json          ← cleaned ARM template (no secrets)
# parameters.example.json ← example only, no real passwords
# README.md              ← documentation
# screenshots/           ← submission evidence
